{
  "reply": "No changes made. `main` inherits `/workspace`; this chat can inspect config, not workspace files.

**MCP:** Once your pinned runtime is installed, propose adding only `mcp.servers.gbrain` with its absolute executable path and stdio arguments. Use `toolFilter.include` for verified read-only tools. Registration is global; `toolFilter` doesn’t scope it to `main`. Verify agent isolation before enabling it. No identity, instruction, or capture changes are needed for registration.

**Turn-rule plugin:** OpenClaw supports reviewed local plugins, but compatibility and agent scoping are unverified for this plugin. The ClawHub GBrain listing doesn’t establish either. Review the pinned manifest and hook code before proposing activation. The Gateway was unreachable, so neither integration was live-tested."
}

